      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Taking excessive melatonin or unsupervised high doses of vitamins can actually disrupt your sleep cycles and worsen mental clarity rather than help. There is no safe, effective supplement dose guaranteed to fix focus without knowing your specific medical history, and self-medicating can lead to dangerous interactions. Given your worries about billing and stress, you might explore community health resources or employer assistance programs that provide free or low-cost access to basic medical screening to rule out serious issues.",
